{"version":1,"id":"khalid-saved","title":"Saved","artist":"Khalid","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/khalid/saved/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Ktoven, Joshua Q Scruggs, Ozan Yildirim, Cam Lazar, Be and Khalid","chords":[{"symbol":"Em7","canonical":"Em7","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm7","canonical":"Bm7","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A4","canonical":"Asus4","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,2,4],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Asus4"}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"The hard part always seems to last forever","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Sometimes I forget that we aren't together","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A4","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Deep down in my heart, I hope you're doing alright","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"But from time to time I often think of why you aren't mine","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A4","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But I'll keep your number saved","columns":31,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause I hope one day you'll get the sense to call me","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm hoping that you'll say","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"You're missing me the way I'm missing you","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A4","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"So I'll keep your number saved","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause I hope one day I'll get the pride to call you","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"To tell you that no one else","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Is gonna hold you down the way that I do","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A4","column":37,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Now, I can't say I'll be alright without you","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"And I can't say that I haven't tried to","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A4","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"But, all your stuff is gone","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I erased all the pictures from my phone","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Of me and you","columns":13,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Heres what I'll do","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A4","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll keep your number saved","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause I hope one day you'll get the sense to call me","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4